{"rank":4,"title":"The picture shows the plots but not the waiting list the headline sells","selector":null,"target":"The plot card shows what happens to plot 3 or plot 8, so that the picture and the headline make one point together, and the caption says that point.","fix_direction":"Keep the plot card. Make it show what happens to plot 3 or plot 8, and change the caption to say that point instead of only naming the garden. The content is for the maker to supply."}
{"rank":null,"title":"Empty cream below the feature row, and the hero halves far apart on widescreen","selector":null,"target":"The space looks planned: content width capped, or the two halves of the hero closer together.","fix_direction":"Cap the content width, or bring the two halves of the hero closer, so the space looks planned."}
{"rank":null,"title":"Feature card text breaks every two words on the tablet","selector":"div.cards > div.card:nth-of-type(1) > p","target":"Two columns of cards, with longer lines than 12 to 15 characters.","fix_direction":"Show the feature cards in two columns on the tablet."}
{"rank":null,"title":"\"Add your garden\" does not say what it costs or what happens next","selector":"a.button","target":"A short line next to the button says what the first step involves.","fix_direction":"Add a short line next to the button that says what the first step involves. That fact is for the maker to supply."}
{"rank":null,"title":"\"Rent is due in March\" reads as a fixed rule","selector":"div.cards > div.card:nth-of-type(3) > p","target":"The line says whether March is an example or a limit.","fix_direction":"Edit the line so it says whether March is an example or a limit."}

